      "writtenOn": "2020-10-08T22:23:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The goal is simply to upgrade to new upstream rust-protobuf 2.18.0 and keep everything working with future upstream releases without local deviation, see aosp/1451283. See https://github.com/stepancheg/rust-protobuf/pull/525 for the new upstream change and how it eliminates the need of current Android local patch.\n\nThis is one of two possible changes I found. The commit message explains why this one is chosen instead of the other one that uses the gen_mod_rs option.\n\nPlease feel free to suggest any other change. I hope we can keep all android rust packages up to the latest version. Thanks.",
      "parentUuid": "98c0182a_f07d97c3",
      "revId": "7fd5be8ba6ddef307b997fe91b545860f0255250",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
